  "description": "Seamless player handoff between world nodes for SetNet: the origin node stashes carried player state under a one-time token and tells the client to reconnect to the destination node, which hands the state back on claim — no re-login crossing a zone boundary. server.UseZones() + client.UseZones(); pluggable IHandoffStore (share a Redis/DB store across nodes). Pairs with SetNet.Sharding for node lookup. Depends only on SetNet.",
